      "content": "That works well. Actually, could you make that middle paragraph a bit more evocative? Like, instead of just 'sneaking up on us,' maybe use a metaphor for how these pains feel like they're working against you or quietly sabotaging your focus? Just something that highlights how they can feel almost mischievous or annoying in how they disrupt your day.",
